# Story 12: Jump & Rename Tabs (40s)
# Hook: Jump to any tab by number, and give your tabs real names.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-012-jump-and-rename-tabs.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 4

[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
Jump to any tab by number, and give your tabs real, memorable names.

[00:04.0 --> 00:16.0]
In tab mode, the number keys 1 through 9 jump directly to a tab by its index.

[00:16.0 --> 00:28.0]
Switch to rysh mode and name the active tab with ##tab name. Here we call it backend.

[00:28.0 --> 00:40.0]
Add a tab ID before the name to rename any tab, not just the active one -- ##tab name, id, then name.

